Package: eyethinkdata
Type: Package
Title: Tools for processing behavioural data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel C.", "Richardson", email = "dcr@eyethink.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0039-9755"))
Description: A Toolbox for behavioural data. Processes raw downloads from gorilla, preps behavioural data for analysis, and extracts and scores information from questionnaires. Performs basic plotting of RDIs (pirate plots), and correlations, ANOVAs and mixed models.
